  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a float that is the time in seconds since midnight GMT. Value appears to be truncated to the second.</p>
  <p>For SL time, which is the same as California time, use <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetWallclock" target="_blank">llGetWallclock</a></p>
</p>
    </div>

